./ralph/codex-output/iteration-000144-20260519-142859.log:756:- Backoffice policy is split by operational domain: `pricing.manage`, `metering.manage`, `billing.manage`, `feature_flags.manage`, `support.manage`, and `config.publish`. Draft/edit routes use the domain manage action; production-impacting publish/archive/rollback routes use `config.publish`; support break-glass/import/reconcile/read routes use `support.manage`. Keep the release support-access static guard pinned to `ActionSupportManage -> CapSupport`.
